<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>10.3 Composing and inverses</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Let \(f(x) = {@fm*x+fc@}\) and \(g(x) = {@ga*x^2+gc@}\).</p>

<p><br>(a) Let \(h(x) = f(g(x))\). What is \(h({@h1@})\) and \(h({@h2@})\)?</p>
<p align="right">\(h({@h1@}) =\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>
<p align="right">\(h({@h2@}) =\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]</p>
<p align="right"><b>(1)</b></p>
<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>

<p><br>(b) Let \(k(x) = g(f(x))\). What is \(k({@k1@})\) and \(k({@k2@})\)?</p>
<p align="right">\(k({@k1@}) =\) [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]]</p>
<p align="right">\(k({@k2@}) =\) [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]]</p>
<p align="right"><b>(1)</b></p>
<p>[[feedback:prt2]]</p>

<p><br>(c) Write down the two possible formulae of \(h^{-1}(x)\)?</p>
<p align="right">\(h^{-1}(x) =\) [[input:ans5]] [[validation:ans5]]</p>
<p align="right">\(h^{-1}(x) =\) [[input:ans6]] [[validation:ans6]]</p>
<p align="right"><b>(2)</b></p>
<p>[[feedback:prt3]]</p>

<p><br>(d) Write down the two possible formulae of \(k^{-1}(x)\)?</p>
<p align="right">\(k^{-1}(x) =\) [[input:ans7]] [[validation:ans7]]</p>
<p align="right">\(k^{-1}(x) =\) [[input:ans8]] [[validation:ans8]]</p>
<p align="right"><b>(2)</b></p>
<p>[[feedback:prt4]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
